repository-code: "https://github.com/ahmaddshbg-blip/regional-coal-production-forecasting"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible data-science portfolio project for quarterly U.S. state coal-
  production forecasting using public MSHA data, chronological rolling-origin
  evaluation, simple baselines, disciplined candidate rejection, uncertainty
  auditing, and one-time final-holdout governance.
